Spec-Driven Development for developers (in AI) means the developer writes a detailed specification of how the AI system should behave before building the implementation, and then uses that spec to guide coding, prompts, models, and evaluations. It turns AI work into something structured and testable, like traditional software engineering. 🧠⚙️

The spec describes:

Inputs
Outputs
Format
Constraints
Evaluation criteria

